[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0010","text":"────甜花，原来你在这里啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0020","text":"嗯……\n有只大鸟，在那边……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0030","text":"甜花和，翅膀的颜色……\n是一样的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0040","text":"哈哈，这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0050","text":"我给你带了点吃的来\n……想着可以当午饭"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0060","text":"三明治……！\n我要吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0070","text":"衣服弄脏就不好了\n先换好衣服再────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0080","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0090","text":"甜花的，三明治……！\n啊呜……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_03_0100","text":"一瞬间就没了……"}]
